# P2 swept from 0 (tight: a grainy copy 4-15 ms behind) through 128 (reach 0.65 s, full width) to 255 (5 s reach,
# feedback 0.8, +-40 cents detune) on drum-like impulses, P1 200: the cloud smears into a wash that the limiter
# holds below 0 dBFS.
tempo 120
steps 96
tail 2
track fx1
input impulse 2 0.9
preset 200 0 0 0 255 0 0 0 128 0 128 255 0 0 0 0 0 0
sweep p2 0 255 0 64
gain 1
transport 0 stop                 # sequencer stopped: the free cloud (sync.scn has the time lock)
expect sound 2 96
expect peak_below 0
